{
  "duration": 52.44,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Same yogurt.",
      "start": 0.16,
      "end": 1.24,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Heavier bowl.",
      "start": 1.44,
      "end": 2.48,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "People said it tasted better.",
      "start": 2.907,
      "end": 4.56,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "In 2011, researchers at Oxford gave fifty people the exact same yogurt in three bowls.",
      "start": 4.94,
      "end": 11.2,
      "matched": "15/15"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "The bowls looked identical.",
      "start": 11.24,
      "end": 13.28,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "The only difference was the weight.",
      "start": 13.36,
      "end": 15.32,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "start": 15.68,
      "end": 16.72,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "From the heaviest bowl, people rated the yogurt denser, nicer, and more expensive.",
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 21.92,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Your brain has a shortcut.",
      "start": 22.24,
      "end": 24.08,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Heavy means quality.",
      "start": 24.36,
      "end": 25.92,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "But it's not that simple.",
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 27.84,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Two years later, the same lab tried heavier spoons.",
      "start": 27.92,
      "end": 31.28,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "The yogurt from the heavy spoon felt cheaper.",
      "start": 31.56,
      "end": 34.24,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "So weight isn't magic.",
      "start": 34.32,
      "end": 36.32,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "It works when it's in the thing that holds the product.",
      "start": 36.457,
      "end": 39.28,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "The bowl, the bottle, the box.",
      "start": 39.36,
      "end": 41.6,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "So if you sell anything premium, put the weight where they hold it.",
      "start": 41.74,
      "end": 45.44,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Thick glass.",
      "start": 45.48,
      "end": 46.4,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "A box with some heft.",
      "start": 46.48,
      "end": 48.08,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Send this to the friend who ships his best product in a flimsy bag.",
      "start": 48.16,
      "end": 51.84,
      "matched": "14/14"
    }
  ],
